  "Java Multithreading Concurrency Performance Optimization": "Java 多线程、并发与性能优化",
  "Learn Rust By Building Real Applications": "通过构建实际应用学习 Rust",
  "Common Data Framework (CoDaF): As one of the main technical leaders, I optimized an internal framework for data persistence. By creating a centralized base, I eliminated information redundancy and increased data consistency across different projects, leading to greater operational efficiency.\n\nCoDaF Wells and Rigs: I conducted interviews with specialists to model a general-use database for oil and gas solutions. This resulted in a robust foundation with approximately 100 entities that serves as a pillar for new projects, ensuring the integrity and standardization of critical business information.\n\nAtria: Technically led the implementation of a pilot project for real-time Machine Learning data processing. This initiative enabled the monitoring of the integrity status of multiple antennas, allowing for proactive fault detection and reducing maintenance costs.\n\nLicense Manager: Architectured and implemented a solution to control client access to the company's products. This system protected intellectual property and revenue streams by preventing misuse of the solutions, ensuring that clients only utilized their contracted features. I also presented the project's functionality to managers, ensuring strategic alignment and a clear understanding of its added value.\n\nRig State: Performed reverse engineering on an application lacking adequate documentation, which provided essential clarity to managers regarding the implemented business rules. This action unblocked the team's ability to proceed with critical modifications safely and with agility.": "Common Data Framework (CoDaF)：作为主要技术负责人之一，我优化了一个用于数据持久化的内部框架。通过创建集中化的基础，我消除了信息冗余，提高了不同项目间的数据一致性，从而提升了运营效率。\n\nCoDaF Wells and Rigs：我与专家进行访谈，为石油天然气解决方案建模了一个通用数据库。这形成了一个包含约100个实体的稳健基础，作为新项目的支柱，确保了关键业务信息的完整性和标准化。\n\nAtria：技术上主导了一个实时机器学习数据处理试点项目的实施。该项目实现了对多个天线完整性状态的监控，能够主动检测故障并降低维护成本。\n\nLicense Manager：设计并实现了一套解决方案，用于控制客户对公司产品的访问。该系统通过防止解决方案被滥用，保护了知识产权和收入来源，确保客户只使用其已签约的功能。我还向管理层展示了该项目的功能，确保战略上的一致性并清晰理解其附加价值。\n\nRig State：对一个缺乏充分文档的应用程序进行了逆向工程，为管理层厘清了已实现的业务规则，提供了必要的清晰度。此举使团队能够安全、敏捷地推进关键的修改工作。",
  "Sequence Builder + Cost Tracker: As one of the main contributors, I developed a system that optimized the planning of oil well activities by generating simulations with time and cost estimates. The system enabled more accurate planning and efficient resource allocation. The ability to compare planned versus actual data provided valuable insights, leading to continuous improvements in operational processes and cost reductions.\n\nDynamic Risk Advisor (DRA): I participated in the development of a real-time operational risk management tool. My contribution helped create a system that empowers users to monitor safety barriers and alerts, thereby increasing safety and efficiency in critical decision-making.": "Sequence Builder + Cost Tracker：作为主要贡献者之一，我开发了一个系统，通过生成带有时间和成本估算的模拟，优化了油井作业活动的规划。该系统实现了更精确的规划和高效的资源分配。将计划数据与实际数据进行比较的能力提供了宝贵的洞察，带来了运营流程的持续改进和成本降低。\n\nDynamic Risk Advisor (DRA)：我参与了一款实时运营风险管理工具的开发。我的贡献帮助创建了一个系统，使用户能够监控安全屏障和警报，从而在关键决策中提高安全性和效率。",
  "Campaign Planner: Contributed to the development and maintenance of an application for managing campaigns in oil and gas operations. My work ensured the system's compatibility and functionality, directly supporting the efficient execution of complex operational plans.\n\nPDF Extractor: Implemented a script that automated the conversion of PDF files to a specific CSV format using OCR. This solution eliminated the research team's manual and time-consuming work, accelerating the acquisition of structured data to feed machine learning models and generate new business opportunities.": "Campaign Planner：为一款用于管理石油天然气业务活动的应用程序的开发和维护做出了贡献。我的工作确保了系统的兼容性和功能性，直接支持了复杂运营计划的高效执行。\n\nPDF Extractor：实现了一个脚本，利用 OCR 自动将 PDF 文件转换为特定的 CSV 格式。该解决方案消除了研究团队手动且耗时的工作，加快了结构化数据的获取，用于训练机器学习模型并创造新的商业机会。",
